  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moroccan pavilion at World Hydrogen Summit 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports Morocco&apos;s participation in the World Hydrogen Summit 2025 through the organisation of a national pavilion presenting the country&apos;s green hydrogen ambitions and project pipeline.The pavilion is coordinated by Cluster Green H2 in cooperation with key institutions, including the Ministry of Energy Transition and Sustainable Development (MTEDD), MASEN and IRESEN.CERF contributes up to &#x20ac;15,000, covering approximately one third of the participation costs. Compared to the previous year, Moroccan partners are taking on a larger share of the financial and organisational responsibilities, demonstrating increasing ownership and commitment to promoting Morocco&apos;s hydrogen sector internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
